  "hindi": "यह वही अत्यन्त विपुल ज्योति अन्धकार से आगे खड़ी हुई है, चिह्नों से युक्त; अब आकाश की पुत्रियाँ, चमकती हुई उषाएँ, जन के लिए मार्ग बनाएँगी।",
  "english": "This, that most abundant light, has stood in front, marked, out of the darkness; now the daughters of heaven, shining forth, the Dawns, shall make a path for the people.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "vayunāvat is uncertain (\"marked\", from vayuna, mark or path; possibly adverbial \"distinctly\"). kṛṇavan is a subjunctive/injunctive form, translated with \"shall\". divaḥ = of heaven. uṣasaḥ is plural, \"the Dawns\".",
  "confidence": "medium"
 },
