  "hindi": "उज्ज्वल उषाएँ आगे खड़ी हुई हैं, यज्ञों में गाड़े गए खम्भों की तरह; उन्होंने उदय होते हुए अन्धकार के बाड़े के द्वार खोल दिए, पवित्र और शुद्ध करने वाली।",
  "english": "The bright Dawns have stood in front, like posts set up at the rites; dawning, they have opened apart the doors of the pen, of the darkness, the pure, purifying ones.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "svaru is rendered \"post\"; mitāḥ \"set up\" (ppp. of √mā). vrajasya tamasaḥ: the two genitives are rendered side by side (\"of the pen, of the darkness\"); whether \"pen of darkness\" is meant is not certain. adhvara = rite.",
  "confidence": "high"
 },
